       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FEAT5.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  REC.
           05 A1  PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
           05 N1  PIC 9(3) VALUE 123.
           05 E1  PIC ZZ9.99 VALUE 4.5.
           05 AL  PIC AAA VALUE "XYZ".
           05 AE  PIC XXBXX VALUE "QQ RR".
           05 FILLER PIC XX VALUE "FF".
           05 T1  PIC 99 OCCURS 3 VALUE 7.
           05 R1  PIC X(2).
           05 R2  REDEFINES R1 PIC 99.
       01  SHOW PIC X(30).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE "SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS" TO REC.
           INITIALIZE REC.
           DISPLAY "1[" REC "]".
           MOVE "SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS" TO REC.
           INITIALIZE REC REPLACING NUMERIC DATA BY 5
                                    ALPHANUMERIC BY "Q".
           DISPLAY "2[" REC "]".
           MOVE "SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS" TO REC.
           INITIALIZE REC WITH FILLER.
           DISPLAY "3[" REC "]".
           MOVE "SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS" TO REC.
           INITIALIZE REC ALL TO VALUE.
           DISPLAY "4[" REC "]".
           MOVE "SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS" TO REC.
           INITIALIZE REC ALL TO VALUE THEN TO DEFAULT.
           DISPLAY "5[" REC "]".
           MOVE "SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS" TO REC.
           INITIALIZE REC NUMERIC TO VALUE
               THEN REPLACING ALPHABETIC BY "M".
           DISPLAY "6[" REC "]".
           MOVE "SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS" TO REC.
           INITIALIZE N1 E1 AE.
           DISPLAY "7[" REC "]".
           STOP RUN.
